      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Since the \\(13\\)th is a Friday, we know that the \\(6\\)th is also a Friday. The \\(1\\)st is \\(5\\) days before the Friday, making it a Sunday.\n\nThus, the answer is A .",
